{"id":"ogon_","lemma":"огонь","pos":"noun","rank":556,"glosses":["fire (also figurative)","light","fire (of weapons)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b7/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"огня","plural":"огни"},"examples":[{"text":"Посмотри на огонь.","en":"Look at the fire.","words":[{"g":"to look","l":"посмотреть"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Я боюсь огня.","en":"I'm afraid of fire.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"},null]},{"text":"Кто начал огонь?","en":"Who fired first?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to begin","l":"начать"},null]},{"text":"Том спас нас из огня.","en":"Tom saved us from the fire.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to save, to rescue","l":"спасти"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"from / out of"},null]},{"text":"Ты зажжёшь огонь?","en":"Will you light the fire?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to set fire","l":"зажечь"},null]}]}